    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A relaxing idle automation game with cozy vibes and adorable little workers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine a variety of ores and refine them into valuable bars in your smelter. Use these bars to unlock new content, buildings, and special resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research technologies to boost your production ,all with the help of your hardworking, cute companions who make everything feel a bit sweeter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock all ores and bars, discover new systems, and enjoy the satisfying sense of constant progress!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ores, research, progress \u2013 your cozy idle adventure begins!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A relaxing idle automation game with cozy vibes and adorable little workers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine a variety of ores and refine them into valuable bars in your smelter. Use these bars to unlock new content, buildings, and special resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research technologies to boost your production ,all with the help of your hardworking, cute companions who make everything feel a bit sweeter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock all ores and bars, discover new systems, and enjoy the satisfying sense of constant progress!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ores, research, progress \u2013 your cozy idle adventure begins!</p>",
    "short_description": "Inspired by many automation and idle games, I wanted to create something centered around ores. With modern desktop games being so easy to run in the background, this is the perfect game to have running while working or gaming on the side.",
